oom: near-full-screen panel, 5-per-page previews,[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]         [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]inline images[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]The Bob Refs panel in Bob Mac Capture opens nearly full screen [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim](1344 × 798 pt on Bryan's 1440 × 870 pt MacBook), its preview [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]column shows 5 annotations per page and reveals 5 more on each [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Ctrl+D, papers, articles, and docs show a larger 150 × 194 pt [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]first-page thumbnail beside the facts, and image highlights and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]image notes render inline with stable layout, so Ctrl+D paging [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]never jumps.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]refs_reading_room.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/refs_reading_room.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-9v[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-9v/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Portable RefsCore model, geometry, and 5-per-page default[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]refs-core-model[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]refs-core-model: decode image fields from ref show, define the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]generalized preview feed (image highlights, attached images, unavailable[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]images, standalone notes), add pure panel/inspector geometry, image [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sizing, and vault-path resolution in RefsCore with Linux tests, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]raise the page size default to 5.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Near-full-screen panel, wide inspector, larger thumbnail[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]big-panel[dim] · [dim][/dim]after refs-core-model[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]big-panel: wire the new geometry into the panel and column split, add [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the wide inspector layout (hero with a 150 × 194 thumbnail beside the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]facts, readable 720 pt column, body typography), render thumbnails at [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the new size behind a versioned cache, let Ctrl+D reveal while the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]disclosure row is visible, and refresh fixtures and README.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Inline images and standalone notes in the preview feed[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]inspector-images[dim] · [dim][/dim]after refs-core-model, big-panel[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]inspector-images: add an ImageIO-backed image loader with metadata [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]prefetch so every image reserves its exact size before layout, render [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]image highlights, attached images, unavailable-image rows, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]standalone notes in the feed, and cover them with loader, hosted reveal,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and render-fixture tests plus README updates.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-9v","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-9v.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-023ee05024a1239a2b6117f37d488f0f","started_at":"2026-10-19T16:35:38.141466+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"f